    "quotes": [
      {
        "speaker": "Jonathan Pollock",
        "quote": "Aviation’s fuel bill is only going one way, and the industry urgently needs alternatives that can scale commercially. Too much SAF technology solves for cleaner fuel without solving for cheaper or more available fuel, largely because it still depends on limited feedstocks like waste cooking oil.",
        "evidence_refs": [
          {
            "source_id": "FISRC-d4882614e143350f",
            "quote": "Aviation’s fuel bill is only going one way, and the industry urgently needs alternatives that can scale commercially",
            "source_content_hash": "d00757ae0cb1ee65a0d004562b0c216c37cda223494a5d49bf2ecc6cf4641053",
            "quote_hash": "cb796ae7127265bd896a06026a2b557578ecd87be2a41c57926866a6ea0fc04c"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speaker": "Deepanshu Singh",
        "quote": "Most SAF today is made from waste oils and fats through HEFA. But the world burns 300 million tons of jet fuel every year, and there is simply nowhere near enough waste oil and fat to meet this demand. Our Controlled Microbial Upcycling process leverages recent advances in AI-driven synthetic biology to convert diverse waste streams like food and agriculture waste into HEFA-compatible feedstocks.",
        "evidence_refs": [
          {
            "source_id": "FISRC-d4882614e143350f",
            "quote": "Most SAF today is made from waste oils and fats through HEFA. But the world burns 300 million tons of jet fuel every year, and there is simply nowhere near enough waste oil and fat to meet this demand",
            "source_content_hash": "d00757ae0cb1ee65a0d004562b0c216c37cda223494a5d49bf2ecc6cf4641053",
            "quote_hash": "fe4d1e73d79c06d31c90917237b196ff4f5e3dad89ee8dcbd16d63656675180c"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speaker": "Deepanshu Singh",
        "quote": "The £2.1 million funding round, led by Elbow Beach, will help us scale towards our pilot and move us closer to making locally produced SAF cost competitive with fossil fuel.",
        "evidence_refs": [
          {
            "source_id": "FISRC-d4882614e143350f",
